const body = "---\ntitle: Mirroring images for a disconnected installation using the oc-mirror plugin\n---\n\n# Mirroring images for a disconnected installation using the oc-mirror plugin {#installing-mirroring-disconnected}\n\nYou can run your cluster in a restricted network by installing from a mirrored set of OpenShift Container Platform container images in a private registry. This registry must be running whenever the cluster is running.\n\nYou can use the oc-mirror OpenShift CLI (`oc`) plugin to mirror images to a mirror registry in your fully or partially disconnected environments. You must run oc-mirror from a system with internet connectivity in order to download the required images from the official Red Hat registries.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The oc-mirror v1 plugin is deprecated. Specify the `--v1` flag to continue using the v1 plugin, or migrate to the supported v2 plugin and use the `--v2` flag. Transition to the oc-mirror v2 plugin for continued support and improvements.\n>\n> For more information, see \"Mirroring images for a disconnected installation\" using oc-mirror plugin v2.\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Viewing the image pull source](/installing/validation_and_troubleshooting/validating-an-installation#viewing-the-image-pull-source_validating-an-installation)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Viewing the image pull source](/installing/validation_and_troubleshooting/validating-an-installation#viewing-the-image-pull-source_validating-an-installation)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Installing and using CLI plugins](/cli_reference/openshift_cli/extending-cli-plugins#cli-installing-plugins_cli-extend-plugins)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Image set configuration parameters](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#oc-mirror-imageset-config-params_installing-mirroring-disconnected)\n- [Image set configuration examples](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#oc-mirror-image-set-examples_installing-mirroring-disconnected)\n- [Using the OpenShift Update Service in a disconnected environment](/disconnected/updating/disconnected-update-osus#updating-disconnected-cluster-osus)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Adding a catalog to a cluster](/extensions/catalogs/managing-catalogs#olmv1-adding-a-catalog-to-a-cluster_managing-catalogs)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Image set configuration examples](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#oc-mirror-image-set-examples_installing-mirroring-disconnected)\n- [Mirroring an image set in a partially disconnected environment](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#mirroring-image-set-partial)\n- [Mirroring an image set in a fully disconnected environment](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#mirroring-image-set-full)\n- [Configuring your cluster to use the resources generated by oc-mirror](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#oc-mirror-updating-cluster-manifests_installing-mirroring-disconnected)\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Configuring your cluster to use the resources generated by oc-mirror](/disconnected/installing-mirroring-disconnected#oc-mirror-updating-cluster-manifests_installing-mirroring-disconnected)\n\n## Additional resources {#additional-resources_installing-mirroring-disconnected}\n\n- [Mirroring images for a disconnected installation using oc-mirror plugin v2](/disconnected/about-installing-oc-mirror-v2#about-installing-oc-mirror-v2)\n- [About cluster updates in a disconnected environment](/disconnected/updating/index#about-disconnected-updates)\n";
